{"3992440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ExoTrain", "steam_appid": 3992440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Company lost contact with its mining planet. The colony is dead, and the only voices left are recordings. To survive, you'll have to craft everything yourself: tools, weapons, even answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRIVE YOUR TRAIN</strong>. Upgrade it and build everything you need for your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/47e0c3b407fa1982e8dc14662f9f3d62.poster.avif?t=1788198839\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/47e0c3b407fa1982e8dc14662f9f3d62.webm?t=1788198839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/47e0c3b407fa1982e8dc14662f9f3d62.mp4?t=1788198839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT TO SURVIVE.</strong> The planet's wildlife is extremely hostile to humans. How convenient that it is also a valuable source of food and resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/51f6a104e0d27656ff8e49ea65b77b17.poster.avif?t=1788198839\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/51f6a104e0d27656ff8e49ea65b77b17.webm?t=1788198839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/51f6a104e0d27656ff8e49ea65b77b17.mp4?t=1788198839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> the remains of the human colony in search of resources and answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MINE AND DEFEND</strong> ore veins. Mining noise attracts many creatures, so you'll need turrets to protect the mining drill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/f2484c1a47a2f1ffc5b089501fc803f7.poster.avif?t=1788198839\" width=616 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/f2484c1a47a2f1ffc5b089501fc803f7.webm?t=1788198839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/f2484c1a47a2f1ffc5b089501fc803f7.mp4?t=1788198839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GATHER RESOURCES TO CRAFT</strong> equipment, gear, and spacesuit modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/b6c3bf820c771ccfad5f457d102f7a40.poster.avif?t=1788198839\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/b6c3bf820c771ccfad5f457d102f7a40.webm?t=1788198839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992440/extras/b6c3bf820c771ccfad5f457d102f7a40.mp4?t=1788198839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY SOLO OR CO-OP with friends!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Company lo